.Dd @NCOLLECTD_DATE@
.Dt NCOLLECTD-LVM 5
.Os ncollectd @NCOLLECTD_VERSION@
.Sh NAME
.Nm ncollectd-lvm
.Nd Documentation of ncollectd's lvm plugin
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal -compact
\fBload-plugin\fP lvm
\fBplugin\fP lvm {
    \fBexec\fP \fI/path/to/lvm\fP
}
.Ed
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The \fBlvm\fP plugin collects metrics form the Logical Volume Manager (LVM),
of the usage of Volume Grousp (VG) and Logical Volumes (LV).
.Pp
The plugin runs \fB/usr/sbin/lvm fullreport\fP with \fB--reportformat json_std\fP,
which requires lvm2 version 2.03.17 or later.
.Pp
The \fBlvm\fP plugin supports the following options:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \fBexec\fP \fIpath\fP
Path to the \fBlvm\fP executable. Default is \fI/usr/sbin/lvm\fP.
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr ncollectd 1 ,
.Xr ncollectd.conf 5
